OL,3,AUS fans with Ed Sheeran tickets are
OL,4,Aleft torn by Macklemore controversy
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm still torn," Damien Given told the
OL,7,FBBC on whether he would attend
OL,8,FSheeran's show on Saturday, calling the
OL,9,Fartist's response disingenuous. Another
OL,10,Ffan called it a "no-win situation".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
