OL,3,AJohnny Marr guitars sell for almost #4m
OL,4,Aat auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuitars owned by The Smiths musician
OL,7,FJohnny Marr have sold for almost #4m at
OL,8,Fauction.
OL,10,FThe instruments, which were used during
OL,11,Fhis time with The Smiths and on his
OL,12,Fforthcoming solo album, went under the
OL,13,Fhammer as part of Christie's Marr's
OL,14,FGuitars: The Johnny Marr Collection
OL,15,Fsale.
OL,17,FThe sale lasted for more than five
OL,18,Fhours and included buyers from 34
OL,19,Fcountries, fetching #3,649,280 - more
OL,20,Fthan three times its estimated value.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
