OL,3,AJohnny Marr guitars sell for almost #4m
OL,4,Aat auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarr said: "The auction has been a
OL,7,Fgreat experience and has exceeded all
OL,8,Fmy expectations. I'd like to thank
OL,9,Feveryone who made bids and special
OL,10,Fthanks to Christie's for making it so
OL,11,Fmemorable."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
